<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= page_title || "Google Fleet Authentication Configuration | Pirate-Civ" %></title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/auth.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=p3_corsair_v1">
    <style>
        .config-card {
            max-width: 580px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 36px 32px;
            background: rgba(14, 8, 12, 0.94);
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 147, 57, 0.45);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            text-align: center;
            color: #d8c3a5;
        }
        .config-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .config-title {
            font-family: "Cinzel", serif;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #ffd700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .config-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: #bfa78a;
        }
        .code-box {
            background: rgba(4, 2, 6, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 147, 57, 0.25);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: left;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #ffd57e;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
        .config-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .btn-config-primary {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a76d1e, #d49339);
            color: #0b0704;
            font-family: "Cinzel", serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn-config-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(212, 147, 57, 0.5);
        }
        .btn-config-secondary {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: rgba(212, 147, 57, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 147, 57, 0.35);
            color: #ffd700;
            font-family: "Cinzel", serif;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn-config-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(212, 147, 57, 0.22);
            color: #ffffff;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="gateway-body" style="min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px;">

    <div class="config-card">
        <div class="config-icon">⚓</div>
        <h1 class="config-title">GOOGLE FLEET AUTHENTICATION</h1>
        <p class="config-desc">
            Pirate-Civ implements server-side Google OAuth 2.0 authorization code flow.
            To connect to Google's live identity fleet in your deployment, set your sovereign credentials in your <code>.env</code> file:
        </p>

        <div class="code-box">
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id_here.apps.googleusercontent.com<br>
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-your_google_client_secret_here<br>
GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL=http://localhost:3000/auth/google/callback
        </div>

        <div class="config-actions">
            <a href="<%= (typeof intent !== 'undefined' && intent === 'seller') ? '/seller/login' : '/buyer/login' %>" class="btn-config-primary">
                Return to Sovereign Sign-In
            </a>
            <a href="<%= (typeof intent !== 'undefined' && intent === 'seller') ? '/seller/register' : '/buyer/register' %>" class="btn-config-secondary">
                Register with Email
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
